CHAPTER.VERS:
When the waves of death surrounded me, the floods of ungodly men made me afraid;
waves: or, pangs
ungodly…: Heb. Belial

The sorrows of hell surrounded me; the snares of death 
        seized me; 

          sorrows: or, cords

He sent from above, he took me; he drew me out of many 
        waters; 

          many: or, great
